     1,
     "<div><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:20px\">Hi,</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:20px\">  I read the paper, &quot;</span><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"3\" style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"border-radius:0.3125rem\">Bayesian</span> <span style=\"border-radius:0.3125rem\">inference</span> <span style=\"border-radius:0.3125rem\">for</span> <span style=\"border-radius:0.3125rem\">additive</span> <span style=\"border-radius:0.3125rem\">mixed</span> <span style=\"border-radius:0.3125rem\">quantile</span> <span style=\"border-radius:0.3125rem\">regression</span> <span style=\"border-radius:0.3125rem\">models</span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:20px\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">&quot;</span> which states that inla can perform quantile regression for continuous variables. The paper includes codes, but when I try to reproduce the results in R, I encounter this error. &quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:20px\"><b>Error in inla(formula, data = Munich, verbose = T, family = &quot;laplace&quot;, :</b></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:20px\"><b>The parameter control.data = list(alpha = 0.5, gamma = 2, epsilon = 0.01) is not used</b>&quot;.</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:20px\">Could you please explain this? </span></div><div><img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/bFzV0DMVMRWjScJ9_iUFC1QWbznihF4ZWIZ3qgiamZZC1d6iAiHWLes1czwdr4CehEWkGb8BIFq15AmP4gFba2kwNZd-ngmIqz3yJ37ros_k9Q_sW92cGy9mN9uU6cOGzaVAvjDMHj7Os57h9T84I-in4VHcM6fGOu9P93HzwcSadWjTgs5EOwbJT_6e0dzINUjeUohq321u2hw4wbB_xphaYcjZBNK15MycICwQuK2-lssJHrU00GE47CmNrW2Xoczyh6FgwN_YKOqJ4mmK4-pKa91nlGRtF-L8MFkuMOu84JDqisYRAl-hQxw_aDxdhTge_FMmFA=s0-d-e1-ft#https://gptsdd.com/file-zgVzxdRU1X8cJn4YlbfufmJg?se=2024-05-25T14%3A10%3A55Z&amp;sp=r&amp;sv=2023-11-03&amp;sr=b&amp;rscc=max-age%3D299%2C%20immutable&amp;rscd=attachment%3B%20filename%3Dimage.png&amp;sig=kSSHT4RkHxtLzCQEdIMwkUbrOsh/VQAMcjXjyWwWyPo%3D\" alt=\"已上传的图片\"> <img alt=\"image.png\" width=\"535px\" height=\"172px\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/attach/41cc1d089ef45/image.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\"> <span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:20px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:20px\">Additionally, I have another question. I have a dependent variable that is a right-skewed continuous variable with many zeros. Is there an appropriate family in INLA that can be used to fit the regression model for such data?</span><br></div>"
