     "<div><div name=\"messageReplySection\"><blockquote type=\"cite\" style=\"border-left-color:grey;border-left-width:thin;border-left-style:solid;margin:5px 5px;padding-left:10px\"><font size=\"4\">sorry, the  accurate error is &quot;Error in inla(formula, data = Munich, verbose = T, family = &quot;laplace&quot;,  :<br>\r\n  unused argument (control.data = list(alpha = 0.5, gamma = 2, epsilon = 0.01))&quot;. Is there any problem? <span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;\">Could you please help me clarify it?</span></font><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">在2024年5月25日星期六 UTC+8 23:57:08&lt;Claire Francis&gt; 写道：<br></div>\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">Yes, I used the R 4.4.0 in Linux. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">在2024年5月25日星期六 UTC+8 23:54:31&lt;Havard Rue&gt; 写道：<br></div>\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div name=\"messageBodySection\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Make sure you have R 4.4 ?</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div name=\"messageSignatureSection\"><br>\r\n-- \r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Håvard Rue </div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a rel=\"nofollow\">hr...@r-inla.org</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div name=\"messageReplySection\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div name=\"messageReplySection\">On 25 May 2024 at 17:16 +0300, Claire Francis &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">gaox...@163.com</a>&gt;, wrote:<br></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div name=\"messageReplySection\">\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\" style=\"border-left-color:grey;border-left-width:thin;border-left-style:solid;margin:5px 5px;padding-left:10px\">\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:20px\">Hi,</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:20px\">I read the paper, &quot;</span><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"3\" style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"border-radius:0.3125rem\">Bayesian</span> <span style=\"border-radius:0.3125rem\">inference</span> <span style=\"border-radius:0.3125rem\">for</span> <span style=\"border-radius:0.3125rem\">additive</span> <span style=\"border-radius:0.3125rem\">mixed</span> <span style=\"border-radius:0.3125rem\">quantile</span> <span style=\"border-radius:0.3125rem\">regression</span> <span style=\"border-radius:0.3125rem\">models</span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:20px\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">&quot;</span> which states that inla can perform quantile regression for continuous variables. The paper includes codes, but when I try to reproduce the results in R, I encounter this error. &quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:20px\"><b>Error in inla(formula, data = Munich, verbose = T, family = &quot;laplace&quot;, :</b></span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:20px\"><b>The parameter control.data = list(alpha = 0.5, gamma = 2, epsilon = 0.01) is not used</b>&quot;.</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:20px\">Could you please explain this?</span></div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div name=\"messageReplySection\">\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\" style=\"border-left-color:grey;border-left-width:thin;border-left-style:solid;margin:5px 5px;padding-left:10px\">\r\n<div><img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/bFzV0DMVMRWjScJ9_iUFC1QWbznihF4ZWIZ3qgiamZZC1d6iAiHWLes1czwdr4CehEWkGb8BIFq15AmP4gFba2kwNZd-ngmIqz3yJ37ros_k9Q_sW92cGy9mN9uU6cOGzaVAvjDMHj7Os57h9T84I-in4VHcM6fGOu9P93HzwcSadWjTgs5EOwbJT_6e0dzINUjeUohq321u2hw4wbB_xphaYcjZBNK15MycICwQuK2-lssJHrU00GE47CmNrW2Xoczyh6FgwN_YKOqJ4mmK4-pKa91nlGRtF-L8MFkuMOu84JDqisYRAl-hQxw_aDxdhTge_FMmFA=s0-d-e1-ft#https://gptsdd.com/file-zgVzxdRU1X8cJn4YlbfufmJg?se=2024-05-25T14%3A10%3A55Z&amp;sp=r&amp;sv=2023-11-03&amp;sr=b&amp;rscc=max-age%3D299%2C%20immutable&amp;rscd=attachment%3B%20filename%3Dimage.png&amp;sig=kSSHT4RkHxtLzCQEdIMwkUbrOsh/VQAMcjXjyWwWyPo%3D\" alt=\"已上传的图片\"> &lt;image.png&gt; <span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:20px\"><br></span></div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div name=\"messageReplySection\">\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\" style=\"border-left-color:grey;border-left-width:thin;border-left-style:solid;margin:5px 5px;padding-left:10px\">\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:20px\">Additionally, I have another question. I have a dependent variable that is a right-skewed continuous variable with many zeros. Is there an appropriate family in INLA that can be used to fit the regression model for such data?</span><br></div>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div name=\"messageReplySection\">\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\" style=\"border-left-color:grey;border-left-width:thin;border-left-style:solid;margin:5px 5px;padding-left:10px\">--<br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;R-inla discussion group&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">r-inla-discussion...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/r-inla-discussion-group/8fbea373-6bb3-43d9-8b6e-7ada111134aan%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"n